{"title": "[新聞] 黃仁勳表態願意重返輝達執行長職位", "author": "DrowningPool (My broken dreams)", "board": "", "date": "Wed Nov 18 00:14:50 2026", "url": "https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/Stock/M.1794932092.A.8C7.html", "body": "原文標題：\n\n請勿刪減或自創標題，違者4-1處分，此行請刪除\n\nJensen Huang signals openness to return as Nvidia CEO\n\n原文連結：\n\n網址超過一行，請用縮網址，連結不能點擊者板規 1-2-2 處分\n。\n\nhttps://reurl.cc/8YdWej\n\n發布時間：\n\n請勿張貼超過3天新聞\n\n2026-11-17\n\n記者署名：\n\n Chris Ciaccia\n\n原文內容：\n\nJensen Huang, the co-founder of Nvidia (NVDA) who resigned last week as CEO\namid concerns about infidelity and national security, said in a statement\nthat he would be “honored” to return as CEO if asked.\n\n“Since my departure, I’ve seen an outpouring of calls from Nvidia’s\nemployees, investors, business partners, and customers for me to return as\nCEO,” Huang said in a statement obtained by multiple news outlets. “If the\nBoard of Directors decides that my return is in the best interest of our\nshareholders, our employees, the company, and America, I would be honored to\nanswer these calls and return as CEO.”\n\nHuang also expressed remorse for having made serious mistakes” in his\npersonal life in his comments. “I did not live up to the standards expected\nof everyone at Nvidia,” Huang added. “I created problems for the Board that\nI deeply regret. I own my mistakes completely.”\n\nNvidia did not immediately respond to a request for comment from Seeking\nAlpha.\n\nSeveral media reports have indicated that Nvidia's board of directors has not\nexpressed interest in bringing back Huang as CEO. On Monday, President Trump\nsaid he would not mind seeing Huang return as CEO.\n\nShares of the tech giant, which reports quarterly earnings tonight after the\nclose of trading, fell 2.5% in late morning trading, off their worst levels\nof the session.\n\n輝達（Nvidia，NASDAQ：NVDA）共同創辦人黃仁勳，上週因婚外情及國家安全疑慮而辭去\n執行長職務。他近日發表聲明表示，如果董事會提出邀請，他將「非常榮幸」能夠重新擔\n任執行長。\n\n黃仁勳在一份由多家新聞媒體取得的聲明中表示：\n「自從我離職以來，我看到了來自輝達員工、投資人、商業合作夥伴及客戶的大量呼聲，\n希望我能夠重返執行長職位。」\n\n「如果董事會認為，我的回歸符合股東、員工、公司以及美國的最佳利益，我將非常榮幸\n回應這些呼聲，重新擔任執行長。」\n\n黃仁勳也在聲明中，對自己在私生活中犯下的「嚴重錯誤」表達悔意。\n\n他進一步表示：\n「我沒有達到輝達對每一位員工所要求的行為標準。」\n\n「我給董事會造成了困擾，對此我深感後悔。我願意為自己的錯誤承擔全部責任。」\n\n針對黃仁勳的聲明，輝達並未立即回覆 Seeking Alpha 的置評請求。\n\n根據多家媒體報導，輝達董事會目前並未表現出有意讓黃仁勳重新擔任執行長的態度。\n\n另一方面，美國總統川普週一表示，他並不介意看到黃仁勳重返輝達執行長職位。\n\n輝達預計於美股當日收盤後公布最新季度財報。\n\n截至當日上午接近中午的交易時段，這家科技巨頭的股價下跌約 2.5%\n\n心得/評論：\n\n老黃在輝達財報前說\n看到了很多人希望他回任\n也首次打破沉默表示願意回歸CEO\n夜盤美股看到WSJ的新聞直接大V\n現在就看董事會怎麼說了", "comments": [{"tag": "推", "user": "flower42", "content": "不惜粉身碎骨！", "time": "11/18 00:15"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "lovebabyqqq", "content": "會不會財報後就宣布回任", "time": "11/18 00:15"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "cuteSquirrel", "content": "Yes, I do.", "time": "11/18 00:15"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "nobeldd", "content": "稍晚又會有其他消息然後又A嗎", "time": "11/18 00:15"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "kinki5566", "content": "應該有喬好什麼吧 他被敲打後應該要對政治有點sense", "time": "11/18 00:15"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "KEDEN", "content": "黃袍加身", "time": "11/18 00:16"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "ethan0419", "content": "好了啦 該放他回去了", "time": "11/18 00:16"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "voluteer", "content": "回鍋 哲哲又要再次封神", "time": "11/18 00:16"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "cry910260", "content": "願意承擔任何重要職務", "time": "11/18 00:16"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "lovebabyqqq", "content": "等一下 還有大官沒買好 再等等", "time": "11/18 00:16"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "pt993526", "content": "演完了 該放回來了", "time": "11/18 00:17"}, {"tag": "噓", "user": "wuz830101", "content": "董事會鬧夠了沒啊", "time": "11/18 00:17"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "ko74652", "content": "利桑雅拉黑", "time": "11/18 00:17"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "guanting886", "content": "大官還沒戲演完", "time": "11/18 00:17"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "gf8752433", "content": "夜盤直接V了700點", "time": "11/18 00:17"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "Brioni", "content": "換輝達管理層尷尬", "time": "11/18 00:17"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "KEDEN", "content": "感覺就是演場戲 這些還在川普的掌握", "time": "11/18 00:17"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "khalid", "content": "肯定知道自己間諜案沒事了 剩下都小事", "time": "11/18 00:17"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "luche", "content": "盧比歐介意嗎